<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87207" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεκ-πίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fall</i> or <i>come out before, precede,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κῦμα π. τοῦ πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					932b37
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>get abroad before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Galb.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἰς γένεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.427e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>go beyond limits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸ ἀδύνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					15.8
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-</span> cod.), cf.<i><span class="en">
				38.1
			</span></i>.</div>
